      en: ["Egypt's first modern large-scale industrial gold mine", "Located in the Eastern Desert, 30 km from Marsa Alam", "First gold pour was successfully achieved in 2009", "Operated as a partnership between Egypt and Centamin PLC", "Total estimated gold reserves exceed 12 million ounces", "Utilizes both open-pit and underground extraction methods"],
